Z||000048||007DOUG||12-27-2000||01:28 AM||||Tina<P> The t-top install & 3.4 swap were done a year and a half ago by The Fiero Factory in AL. I just need the time to install the body.<P>Here's a REALLY general picture series of the T-top install: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/ttopinstall.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/ttopinstall.html</A>  I took them a horribly rusted 84 coupe w/T-tops. They removed the T-tops, and installed them in a perfect 86 GT frame. <P>My suggestion: Pay FF to install. They have all the proper tools and most importantly......the expierence!! I know there's a few forum mebers installing t-tops themselves right now. They know where i'm coming from.||||reg||1
